{"speciesId":454,"names":{"fr":"Coatox","es":"Toxicroak","en":"Toxicroak","ja":"ドクロッグ"},"descriptions":[{"language":"en","version":"diamond","text":"Its knuckle claws secrete a toxin so vile that even a scratch could prove fatal."},{"language":"en","version":"pearl","text":"The toxin made in its poison sacs is pumped to the knuckle claws through tubes down its arms."},{"language":"en","version":"platinum","text":"It has a poison sac at its throat. When it croaks, the stored poison is churned for greater potency."},{"language":"en","version":"heartgold","text":"Swaying and dodging the attacks of its foes, it weaves its flexible body in close, then lunges out with its poisonous claws."},{"language":"en","version":"soulsilver","text":"Swaying and dodging the attacks of its foes, it weaves its flexible body in close, then lunges out with its poisonous claws."},{"language":"fr","version":"black","text":"Quand il coasse, le poison stocké sous sa gorge est secoué, le rendant ainsi plus efficace."},{"language":"en","version":"black","text":"It has a poison sac at its throat. When it croaks, the stored poison is churned for greater potency."},{"language":"fr","version":"white","text":"Quand il coasse, le poison stocké sous sa gorge est secoué, le rendant ainsi plus efficace."},{"language":"en","version":"white","text":"It has a poison sac at its throat. When it croaks, the stored poison is churned for greater potency."},{"language":"en","version":"black-2","text":"The croaking that Toxicroak produces before a battle is for churning the poison it has stored in its poison sac."},{"language":"en","version":"white-2","text":"The croaking that Toxicroak produces before a battle is for churning the poison it has stored in its poison sac."},{"language":"fr","version":"x","text":"Quand il coasse, le poison stocké sous sa gorge est secoué, le rendant ainsi plus efficace."},{"language":"es","version":"x","text":"Almacena veneno en una bolsa de la garganta. Cuando croa, este se agita para lograr mayor potencia."},{"language":"en","version":"x","text":"It has a poison sac at its throat. When it croaks, the stored poison is churned for greater potency."},{"language":"ja","version":"x","text":"のど元に 毒袋を 持つ。 のどを 鳴らすと たまった 毒は 練りこまれ 強力になる。"},{"language":"fr","version":"y","text":"Les griffes de ses poings sécrètent une toxine si atroce qu’une simple égratignure peut s’avérer fatale."},{"language":"es","version":"y","text":"Sus garras segregan una toxina tan potente que un simple arañazo puede ser mortal."},{"language":"en","version":"y","text":"Its knuckle claws secrete a toxin so vile that even a scratch could prove fatal."},{"language":"ja","version":"y","text":"こぶしの トゲからは かすり傷でも 命を 落とすほどの 猛毒を 分泌する。"},{"language":"fr","version":"omega-ruby","text":"Quand il coasse, le poison stocké sous sa gorge est secoué, le rendant ainsi plus efficace."},{"language":"es","version":"omega-ruby","text":"Almacena veneno en una bolsa de la garganta. Cuando croa, este se agita para lograr mayor potencia."},{"language":"en","version":"omega-ruby","text":"It has a poison sac at its throat. When it croaks, the stored poison is churned for greater potency."},{"language":"ja","version":"omega-ruby","text":"のど元に 毒袋を 持つ。 のどを 鳴らすと たまった 毒は 練りこまれ 強力になる。"},{"language":"fr","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"Les griffes de ses poings sécrètent une toxine si atroce qu’une simple égratignure peut s’avérer fatale."},{"language":"es","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"Sus garras segregan una toxina tan potente que un simple arañazo puede ser mortal."},{"language":"en","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"Its knuckle claws secrete a toxin so vile that even a scratch could prove fatal."},{"language":"ja","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"こぶしの トゲからは かすり傷でも 命を 落とすほどの 猛毒を 分泌する。"},{"language":"fr","version":"sword","text":"Il bondit sur ses adversaires pour les transpercer avec ses griffes empoisonnées. Une simple égratignure suffit à les mettre K.O."},{"language":"es","version":"sword","text":"Se abalanza sobre el rival y lo destroza con sus garras venenosas. Basta un rasguño para debilitar al adversario."},{"language":"en","version":"sword","text":"It bounces toward opponents and gouges them with poisonous claws. No more than a scratch is needed to knock out its adversaries."},{"language":"ja","version":"sword","text":"跳ねるように 敵に 近づくと 毒のツメで えぐるように 打つ！ かすり傷でも 相手は ＫＯだ。"},{"language":"fr","version":"shield","text":"Il lance un coassement viril de victoire quand il parvient à terrasser sa proie. Il s’apparente aux Crapustule."},{"language":"es","version":"shield","text":"Cuando abate una presa, emite un croar de victoria a pleno pulmón. Está emparentado con los Seismitoad."},{"language":"en","version":"shield","text":"It booms out a victory croak when its prey goes down in defeat. This Pokémon and Seismitoad are related species."},{"language":"ja","version":"shield","text":"獲物を しとめると ゲロゲロと 勝利の 雄叫びを あげる。 ガマゲロゲと 種として 近い。"},{"language":"en","version":"legends-arceus","text":"Its crimson claws contain a virulent toxin. This toxin can be made into a tonic by diluting it, mixing it with several types of wild grass, and boiling it down over two days."}],"varieties":[{"id":454,"moves":[{"name":"mega-punch","learns":[[20,"machine",0]]},{"name":"ice-punch","learns":[[9,"tutor",0],[10,"tutor",0],[14,"tutor",0],[16,"tutor",0],[18,"tutor",0],[20,"machine",0],[25,"machine",0],[32,"train",0]]},{"name":"thunder-punch","learns":[[9,"tutor",0],[10,"tutor",0],[14,"tutor",0],[16,"tutor",0],[18,"tutor",0],[20,"machine",0],[25,"machine",0],[32,"train",0]]},{"name":"swords-dance","learns":[[8,"machine",0],[9,"machine",0],[10,"machine",0],[11,"machine",0],[14,"machine",0],[15,"machine",0],[16,"machine",0],[17,"machine",0],[18,"machine",0],[20,"machine",0],[23,"machine",0],[25,"machine",0],[32,"train",0]]},{"name":"cut","learns":[[8,"machine",0],[9,"machine",0],[10,"machine",0],[11,"machine",0],[14,"machine",0],[15,"machine",0],[16,"machine",0],[23,"machine",0]]},{"name":"mega-kic